WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:15.020
Last time: AI can be wrong. Check with a person!

3
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:24.770
Chapter 5 · AI Helpers Around the World

4
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:33.130
Let's see how AI helps people every day!

5
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.000
Meet Meera from Chennai. She speaks Tamil.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.480
New neighbour Arjun speaks Hindi

7
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:59.590
"Vaa, cricket vilaiyaadalaam!" Arjun is lost

8
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:08.350
How can they understand each other? Think!

9
00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:16.860
Appa opens a translation app

10
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:27.450
It says it in Hindi: "Aao, cricket khelein!"

11
00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:37.350
Translation: words from one language to another

12
00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:52.340
Not magic: it learned patterns from examples

13
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:59.560
Sunday trip to nani's house!

14
00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:09.330
Map app = navigation: finding the way

15
00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:20.720
It warns about a traffic jam ahead

16
00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:28.470
"Turn left in 200 metres."

17
00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:36.820
Nani can't hear very well

18
00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:46.950
Captions: words on a video to read what is said

19
00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:57.600
Captions help in noisy rooms too!

20
00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:05.420
Psst… these words are captions too!

21
00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:10.300
Let's zoom out to the whole world!

22
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:24.160
Japan · Brazil · Kenya · India

23
00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:35.350
Same idea, in local languages

24
00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:45.140
Will AI replace teachers and parents?

25
00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:56.790
AI helps people. It doesn't replace them.

26
00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:07.310
Teachers and parents still guide you

27
00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:15.560
Match the helper to the job!

28
00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:29.210
Which helper does which job?

29
00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:41.840
Map: directions · Captions: words · Translate

30
00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:58.850
Read a strange sign, then find the hotel?

31
00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:07.380
Translation for the sign + map for the hotel

32
00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:11.330
Your turn: practice check

33
00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:21.430
How can translation AI help two children?

34
00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:35.780
It turns words into the other child's language

35
00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:41.650
Translation: across languages

36
00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.490
Map apps: find the way

37
00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.930
Captions: read what is said

38
00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:51.320
AI helps. It doesn't replace people.

39
00:05:51.320 --> 00:06:05.850
Chapter 5 done · Unit 1 complete!

40
00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:12.650
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
